    "existing_behavior": "The installed baseline qwen3_xml name already resolves to Qwen3EngineToolParser/Qwen3ParserToolAdapter and qwen3_config already enables stream_arg_deltas. Its _compute_arg_delta converts accumulated arguments and emits the new safe JSON suffix.",
    "new_behavior": "The candidate qwen3_config installs _qwen3_arg_value_extender. ParserEngine retains an extender for the trailing open parameter and directly appends escaped new value text; it falls back to conversion when a parameter delimiter arrives. This reduces repeated conversion of long growing values while retaining the existing stream format.",
